{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）凌晨3時53分，警方接獲報案，指一名男子形跡可疑，懷疑攜帶類似長槍的物品。人員接報到場，在落馬洲坑頭村發現該名61歲梁姓男子，並檢獲兩把懷疑仿製槍械。經初步調查，他涉嫌「管有仿製槍械」被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:04:17.454896+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:40:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T05:07:15.459624+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:57:46.916143+00:00","content_hash":"4c9ae0474ae2704692b6ea15e0bd1331263d23b3ee142e78ea47ccfdf66a5403","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}